                                "sense_id": "dd218f63-fbcd-3aaf-a13f-21d27b331c7f",
                                "text": "The fad began with a lone male running naked across the Florida State University campus several weeks ago. Students on other campuses began streaking in pairs, then groups, and were joined by some coeds. Then it became a numbers game for the “national streaking title.”"
                            },
                            {
