                                "sense_id": "dd218f63-fbcd-3aaf-a13f-21d27b331c7f",
                                "text": "By February 1974, a fad labeled “streaking” had crystalized on scores of college, and even some high school, campuses across the United States."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "762c176f-aab6-4c86-8889-8aa607a7ed8a",
                                "sense_id": "dd218f63-fbcd-3aaf-a13f-21d27b331c7f",
                                "text": "Canadian Football League spokesman Shawn Lackie called streaking the “flavour of the day,” but added it's not a growing problem."
                            }
                        ]
